# StoreBridge — optional environment variables
#
# Nothing is required here. Both platforms are read through their
# public, unauthenticated storefront endpoints — you just paste a URL
# in the dashboard, no keys or tokens involved.
#
# The variable pair below is an optional extra: it puts the deployed
# app itself behind HTTP Basic Auth (see proxy.ts), which is worth
# turning on so random visitors can't use your deployment to scrape
# arbitrary stores. Leave both unset to disable.
BASIC_AUTH_USER=
BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD=
